            <h3 id="xmove">XMove Mouse events</h3>
            <p>XMove simulates mouse events. For simulating mouse clicks, use XClick.</p>
            <p>
                <table class="table table-bordered" id="code">
                    <thead>
                    <th class="col-md-3">Click event command</th>
                    <th class="col-md-8">Comment</th>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td> <span class="hired">„“ (empty) or #move</span></td>
                            <td>
                                Simulates mouse move events. A move over an element also triggers the mouse over effect.
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td> <span class="hired">#up</span></td>
                            <td>
                                Simulates mouse up event of the left mouse button
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td> <span class="hired">#down</span></td>
                            <td>
                                Simulates mouse down event of the left mouse button
                            </td>
                        </tr>


                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </p>





